\begin_inset Formula $\mathcal{D}_{i}$
\end_inset

 הוא מהצורה
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
\begin_inset Formula $\overline{\pi_{i}\left(C_{1}\right)}\cap\ldots\cap\overline{\pi_{i}\left(C_{n}\right)}$
